  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><title>BodeeGuard — Parent Dashboard</title>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/bodeeguard-logo.png\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/guard-admin/base.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/guard-admin/monitoring.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/guard-admin/cloud-workspace.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/guard-admin/cloud-messages.css\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"></head>\n<body><div id=\"admin-dashboard\" class=\"admin-dashboard active cloud-workspace\"><aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"sidebar-logo\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--accent-purple);margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle;\"></i>\n        <h2 id=\"sidebar-school-name\" style=\"display:inline;\">BodeeGuard</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Live sync indicator -->\n      <div id=\"live-indicator\" style=\"margin:0 12px 8px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:8px;\n        background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);\n        display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; font-size:11px; color:#f87171;\n        transition: all 0.3s ease; cursor:default;\" title=\"Real-time sync status\">\n        <span id=\"live-dot\" style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;flex-shrink:0;\"></span>\n        <span id=\"live-text\">Connecting…</span>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"sidebar-nav\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item active\" data-tab=\"overview\"><i data-lucide=\"layout-dashboard\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Overview <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"alert-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"messages\" id=\"messages-nav-item\"><i data-lucide=\"message-square\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Messages <span class=\"help-badge\" id=\"messages-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"screenshots\"><i data-lucide=\"camera\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Screenshots</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"students\"><i data-lucide=\"users\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Students</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"grades\"><i data-lucide=\"notebook-tabs\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Grades <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"grades-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-group\" data-nav-group=\"learning\">\n          <button class=\"nav-group-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-group-learning\" title=\"Learning setup\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"library-big\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i><span>Learning</span><span class=\"nav-group-alert\" hidden></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"nav-group-chevron\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"nav-group-items\" id=\"nav-group-learning\" hidden>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"subjects\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Subjects</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"math-coach\"><i data-lucide=\"sigma\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Math Coach</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"learning-videos\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Learning Videos</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"calendar\"><i data-lucide=\"calendar-days\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Calendar / Schedule</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"spelling\"><i data-lucide=\"spell-check-2\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Spelling</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"science-spelling\"><i data-lucide=\"flask-conical\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Science Spelling</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"vocabulary\"><i data-lucide=\"book-a\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Vocabulary</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"poems\"><i data-lucide=\"quote\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Poems</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"quizzes\"><i data-lucide=\"help-circle\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Quizzes</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"worksheets\"><i data-lucide=\"printer\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Worksheets</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"abeka-assessments\" hidden style=\"display:none;\"><i data-lucide=\"clipboard-check\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Abeka Test Unlocks</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-group\" data-nav-group=\"media-family\">\n          <button class=\"nav-group-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-group-media-family\" title=\"Media and family activities\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"radio-tower\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i><span>Media &amp; Family</span><span class=\"nav-group-alert\" hidden></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"nav-group-chevron\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"nav-group-items\" id=\"nav-group-media-family\" hidden>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"family-watch\"><i data-lucide=\"radio\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Family Watch <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"family-watch-live-badge\" style=\"display:none\">LIVE</span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"family-games\"><i data-lucide=\"gamepad-2\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Family Games</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"music\"><i data-lucide=\"music\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Music Library</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"videos\"><i data-lucide=\"tv-2\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Videos <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"video-flags-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"audiobooks\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Audiobooks</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-group\" data-nav-group=\"creative-files\">\n          <button class=\"nav-group-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-group-creative-files\" title=\"Creative tools and files\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"palette\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i><span>Creative &amp; Files</span><span class=\"nav-group-alert\" hidden></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"nav-group-chevron\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"nav-group-items\" id=\"nav-group-creative-files\" hidden>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"documents\"><i data-lucide=\"file-text\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Documents</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"sand-tray\"><i data-lucide=\"shovel\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Sand Tray <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"sand-tray-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"coloring-studio\"><i data-lucide=\"pencil-ruler\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Coloring Studio <span class=\"alert-badge\" id=\"coloring-studio-badge\" style=\"display:none\"></span></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-group\" data-nav-group=\"reports-safety\">\n          <button class=\"nav-group-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-group-reports-safety\" title=\"Reports and safety\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i><span>Reports &amp; Safety</span><span class=\"nav-group-alert\" hidden></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"nav-group-chevron\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"nav-group-items\" id=\"nav-group-reports-safety\" hidden>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"reports\"><i data-lucide=\"bar-chart-2\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Reports</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"browsing\"><i data-lucide=\"globe\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Browsing Activity</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-group\" data-nav-group=\"system-rewards\">\n          <button class=\"nav-group-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-group-system-rewards\" title=\"System and rewards\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"sliders-horizontal\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i><span>System &amp; Rewards</span><span class=\"nav-group-alert\" hidden></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"nav-group-chevron\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"nav-group-items\" id=\"nav-group-system-rewards\" hidden>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"economy\"><i data-lucide=\"coins\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Economy</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"apps\"><i data-lucide=\"app-window\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> App Launcher</button>\n            <button class=\"nav-item\" data-tab=\"settings\"><i data-lucide=\"settings\" class=\"nav-icon\"></i> Settings</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n\n      <!-- Connected Computers (sidebar) -->\n      <div class=\"sidebar-clients\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-clients-header\">\n          <span><i data-lucide=\"laptop\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:middle;\"></i> Computers</span>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"clients-panel\">\n          <p class=\"clients-empty\">Connecting…</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Logged-in admin badge -->\n      <div id=\"admin-user-badge\" style=\"padding:12px 16px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); margin-top:auto; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\n        <div id=\"admin-badge-avatar\" style=\"width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; background:rgba(139,92,246,0.2); border:1.5px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.4); flex-shrink:0;\">🔑</div>\n        <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n          <div id=\"admin-badge-name\" style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-primary); white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;\">Parent account</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Logged in</div>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"cloud-account-link\" href=\"/guard/account/\" target=\"_top\" aria-label=\"Account and sign out\">Account</a>\n      </div>\n    </aside><main class=\"main-content\">\n<p class=\"cloud-migration-note\">Private cloud transfer preview. Current installations and family records are unchanged. Only cloud test computers appear here; the protected installer is not ready.</p>\n<p id=\"cloud-feedback\" class=\"cloud-feedback\" role=\"status\">Connecting to your parent account…</p><section class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-overview\" aria-label=\"Overview\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Live Monitoring</h1><div class=\"cloud-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/guard/activate/\" target=\"_top\">Approve a computer</a><button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"cloud-refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh</button></div></div>\n      <p class=\"cloud-note\">Cloud connection updates every 30 seconds while you are viewing this page. Your parent computer does not need to stay on. School time received is not verified lesson completion.</p>\n      <div class=\"overview-grid monitor-grid\" id=\"overview-grid\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-messages\" aria-label=\"Messages\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Messages</h1></div><p class=\"cloud-note\">Private conversations with cloud test children. Attach an image, PDF or audio file up to 2 MB. Received means the message reached the computer, not that its attachment was opened. Existing LAN conversations and microphone recording are still being transferred.</p>\n      <div class=\"cloud-chat-layout\"><div class=\"cloud-chat-people\"><h2>Conversations</h2><div id=\"messages-student-list\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"cloud-chat-conversation\"><h2 id=\"messages-thread-header\">Select a student to view messages.</h2><p id=\"messages-cloud-status\" class=\"cloud-chat-note\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <button id=\"messages-older\" class=\"btn btn-secondary cloud-chat-history\" disabled>Older messages</button><div id=\"messages-thread-content\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation\"></div>\n      <form id=\"messages-reply-box\" class=\"cloud-chat-compose\"><label for=\"messages-reply-input\">Message<textarea id=\"messages-reply-input\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\" disabled></textarea></label><label>Attachment (optional)<input id=\"messages-attachment\" type=\"file\" accept=\".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.pdf,.wav,.mp3,.webm,.ogg\" disabled></label><p id=\"messages-attachment-status\" role=\"status\"></p><button id=\"messages-reply-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" disabled>Send</button></form></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-screenshots\" aria-label=\"Screenshots\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Screenshots</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Screenshots is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p><p>Cloud screenshots will be parent-requested only, not captured automatically.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-students\" aria-label=\"Students\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Student Management</h1><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"add-student-btn\" type=\"button\">+ Add Student</button></div><div class=\"students-list\" id=\"students-list\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-grades\" aria-label=\"Grades\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Gradebook</h1><button id=\"cloud-add-grade\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-cloud-mutation>+ Add Grade</button></div><p class=\"cloud-note\">Manually enter and review grades in your online account. Children see their own saved grades and feedback. Submitted papers are below. Automatic grading, quiz capture, course averages, and existing LAN grades are still being transferred.</p>\n      <form id=\"cloud-grades-filters\" class=\"cloud-record-filters\"><label>Student<select name=\"studentId\" class=\"admin-input\"></select></label><label>From (optional)<input type=\"date\" name=\"start\" class=\"admin-input\"></label><label>Through (optional)<input type=\"date\" name=\"end\" class=\"admin-input\"></label><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Refresh / newest</button></form><p id=\"cloud-grades-status\" class=\"cloud-note\" role=\"status\"></p><div id=\"cloud-grades-results\"></div><button id=\"cloud-grades-older\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" disabled>Older grades</button>\n      <section class=\"cloud-papers\"><h2>Submitted papers &amp; private files</h2><p>Open a paper to review, zoom, rotate and download it. Record its score and feedback with Add Grade above. Automatic grading and importing existing LAN files are not enabled yet.</p><form id=\"cloud-paper-form\" class=\"cloud-file-controls\"><label>Child<select id=\"cloud-paper-student\" required></select></label><label>Paper (up to 2 MB)<input id=\"cloud-paper-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.pdf\" required></label><button id=\"cloud-paper-upload\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Upload paper</button></form><button id=\"cloud-files-refresh\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Refresh files</button><p id=\"cloud-files-status\" role=\"status\"></p><div id=\"cloud-files-list\"></div></section></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-subjects\" aria-label=\"Subjects\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Subject Management</h1><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"add-subject-btn\" type=\"button\">+ Add Subject</button></div><p class=\"cloud-note\">Choose which children receive each school link and set a daily time goal. Time is securely measured by the child app; curriculum lesson completion still comes from the school provider.</p><div class=\"subjects-grid-admin\" id=\"subjects-grid-admin\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-math-coach\" aria-label=\"Math Coach\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Math Coach</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Math Coach is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-learning-videos\" aria-label=\"Learning Videos\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Learning Videos</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Learning Videos is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-calendar\" aria-label=\"Calendar / Schedule\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Calendar &amp; Schedule</h1><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"edit-school-schedule\" type=\"button\" data-cloud-mutation>Set weekly hours and school year</button></div>\n      <div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Family school calendar</h2><p id=\"cloud-school-schedule-summary\">Loading the family schedule…</p><p id=\"cloud-school-term-summary\"></p><p id=\"cloud-calendar-enabled-note\" class=\"cloud-note\"></p>\n      <div class=\"cloud-calendar-toolbar\"><div class=\"cloud-actions\"><button id=\"cloud-calendar-previous\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous month\">←</button><h2 id=\"cloud-calendar-month\" aria-live=\"polite\"></h2><button id=\"cloud-calendar-next\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next month\">→</button></div><button id=\"cloud-calendar-today\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Today</button></div>\n      <div class=\"cloud-calendar-layout\"><div class=\"cloud-table-wrap\"><table class=\"cloud-month-table\" aria-labelledby=\"cloud-calendar-month\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sun</th><th scope=\"col\">Mon</th><th scope=\"col\">Tue</th><th scope=\"col\">Wed</th><th scope=\"col\">Thu</th><th scope=\"col\">Fri</th><th scope=\"col\">Sat</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"cloud-calendar-days\"></tbody></table></div><section id=\"cloud-calendar-day-details\" class=\"cloud-day-details\" aria-label=\"Selected school day\"></section></div></div>\n      <div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Vacations, holidays, and exceptions</h2><p class=\"cloud-note\">An open-day exception uses your usual school hours. Individual subjects can have shorter hours, set under Subjects.</p><div id=\"cloud-school-calendar-items\"></div><div class=\"cloud-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"add-school-break\" type=\"button\" data-cloud-mutation>Add vacation or holiday</button><button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"add-day-exception\" type=\"button\" data-cloud-mutation>Add one-day exception</button></div></div>\n      <p class=\"cloud-note\">School check-in bonuses and late deductions are still available in the installed Admin app; they have not moved to this calendar yet.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-spelling\" aria-label=\"Spelling\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Spelling</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Spelling is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-science-spelling\" aria-label=\"Science Spelling\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Science Spelling</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Science Spelling is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-vocabulary\" aria-label=\"Vocabulary\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Vocabulary</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Vocabulary is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-poems\" aria-label=\"Poems\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Poems</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Poems is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-quizzes\" aria-label=\"Quizzes\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Quizzes</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Quizzes is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-worksheets\" aria-label=\"Worksheets\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Worksheets</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Worksheets is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-abeka-assessments\" aria-label=\"Abeka Test Unlocks\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Abeka Test Unlocks</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Abeka Test Unlocks is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-family-watch\" aria-label=\"Family Watch\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Family Watch</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Family Watch is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-family-games\" aria-label=\"Family Games\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Family Games</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Family Games is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-music\" aria-label=\"Music Library\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Music Library</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Music Library is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-videos\" aria-label=\"Videos\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Videos</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Videos is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-audiobooks\" aria-label=\"Audiobooks\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Audiobooks</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h2>Not connected to cloud yet</h2><p>Audiobooks is still available in your current Admin app. Its existing screen and functions will be transferred here; no local records have been moved or deleted.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-documents\" aria-label=\"Documents\"><div class=\"tab-header\"><h1>Documents</h1></div><div class=\"cloud-panel\"><h